Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.00,0:05:08.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《普罗米修斯》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.58,0:05:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去找查理!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍罗威博士!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Holloway!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:49.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.69,0:05:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(苏格兰天空岛 2089年)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:36.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 年代测定过了么? - 有35000年了 也许更久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you date it? - Thirty-five thousand years. Maybe older.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一样的星布局形状\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the same configuration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个年代比其他的要早了千年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's gotta predate the others by millennia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是想要我们来这里并发现他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they want us to come and find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:31.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.39,0:07:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(科学考察船: 普罗米修斯号)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.24,0:07:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(船员人数: 17名)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.52,0:07:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(日期: 2093年12月21日)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:08:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(距离地球: 327兆公里)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(目的地: 不明)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.98,0:08:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(伊丽莎白·肖博士  神经-面罩  连接建立)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:40.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那人怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to that man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.60,0:08:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.14,0:08:44.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不帮他们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why aren't you helping them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不需要我的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't want my help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的神和我们可不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their God is different than ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么会死?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did he die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为无论早晚 每个人都会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because sooner or later, everyone does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:08:57.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像妈妈一样么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Mummy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像妈妈一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Mummy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.29,0:09:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她去了哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do they go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都去自己的归宿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone has their own word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heaven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.63,0:09:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乐园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paradise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管它叫什么 反正是美好的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it's called, it's someplace beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道是美好的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know it's beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I choose to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你选择相信什么呢 艾丽?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you believe, Ellie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.69,0:09:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(伊丽莎白·肖博士  神经-面罩  连接终止)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:09:58.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.18,0:10:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发送讯息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Transmitting message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No response.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.40,0:10:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然而这种发音...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whilst this articulation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被证实是印欧语系后裔的语言...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is attested in the Indo-European descendants...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作为一种纯粹的附属语言构成...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as a purely paralinguistic form...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其语音形成形式可以追溯至...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is phonemic in the ancestral form dating back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,5000年以前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}five millennia or more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.87,0:10:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在开始练习施莱谢尔寓言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's attempt Schleicher's fable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.88,0:10:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat after me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.77,0:10:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 劳伦斯先生 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Lawrence? - Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 复写纸 先生 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Flimsy, sir. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:11:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又做到了一次 那可是血肉啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do that once too often. It's only flesh and blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔·乔治·哈特利 你是哲学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michael George Hartley, you're a philosopher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.95,0:11:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你太笨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're barmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真的很疼! - 当然痛啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It damn well hurts! - Certainly, it hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.21,0:11:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你有什么窍门?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what's the trick, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.59,0:11:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,窍门 威廉·帕特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trick, William Potter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.13,0:11:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是别光想着痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is not minding that it hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.13,0:11:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,窍门 威廉·帕特...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trick, William Potter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是别光想着痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is not minding that it hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,窍门 威廉·帕特...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trick, William Potter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是别想着痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is not minding that it hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抵达目的地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destination threshold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.88,0:11:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抵达目的地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destination threshold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.34,0:12:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意: 抵达目的地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention: Destination threshold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿袍子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2年 4个月 18天36小时 15分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two years, four months, 18 days 36 hours, 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.22,0:13:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人员伤亡没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any casualties?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伤亡情况 女士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Casualties, ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.30,0:13:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有人死了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has anyone died?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.93,0:13:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 女士 每个人都很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, ma'am. Everyone is fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.93,0:13:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好 叫他们起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then wake them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放松一下 肖博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to relax, Dr. Shaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的身体处于休克痉挛状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mind and body are in a state of shock...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是长期休眠造成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as a result of the stasis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 相当正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. Perfectly normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:13:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们到了 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.59,0:14:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你 给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喝多点水 吃多点流体食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drink plenty of water. Drink plenty of fluids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有助于恢复肌肉组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydration aids muscle mass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.60,0:14:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位船员 应进食高热量的奶酪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All crew, consume shakes with high caloric content.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.95,0:14:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么玩意儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是圣诞节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Christmas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.49,0:14:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要过节日来显示时间仍在运转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need the holidays to show time is still moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任务简报开始了 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission briefing is about to start, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你何不快点前去呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might wanna make your way down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可没被通知到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I haven't had any breakfast yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没占座吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this seat taken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫密尔本 生物学家 很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, I'm Millburn, Biology. Nice to meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.64,0:14:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧 别介意 但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, no offense, but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经睡了2年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been asleep two years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.31,0:15:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我像是来交朋友的么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't here to be your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是来赚钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to make money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.61,0:15:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懂了没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.49,0:15:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.16,0:15:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我赌100点数这次是做地貌环境改造调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet a hundred credits it's a terraforming survey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 如果是一次调查 他们会跟我们说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, if it's a survey, they would tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一次公司行为 他们不会跟我们说废话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a corporate run, they're not telling us shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.58,0:15:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那就100点吧 - 好的 你来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A hundred. - All right, you're on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去很紧张 艾丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look nervous, El.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我要尽力让自己的脚站住  - 我知道你会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll try to keep my feet on the ground. - I know you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.18,0:15:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这话是对那些我亲自雇的人说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For those of you I hired personally...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的很高兴再见到你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's nice to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.31,0:15:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的人注意了 我叫梅瑞迪斯·维克丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the rest of you, I am Meredith Vickers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.24,0:15:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的工作就是监督你们好好工作的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my job to make sure you do yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.69,0:15:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧...开始播放吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, then. On with the show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维兰德企业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland Corporation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.87,0:15:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,建造更好的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Building better worlds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.16,0:15:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好 朋友们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我叫皮特·维兰德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Peter Weyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你们的雇主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am your employer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这段录制于2091年6月22日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am recording this, 22 June, 2091.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们在收看的话...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you're watching it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说明你们已经抵达目的地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have reached your destination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我或已早死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am long dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿我安息吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I rest in peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天你们中间有个人 他的名字叫大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a man sitting with you today. His name is David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就像我应有的儿子一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he is the closest thing to a son I will ever have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很可惜 他不是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, he is not human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.74,0:16:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不会老...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will never grow old...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he will never die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.07,0:16:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他也不会懂得孤芳自赏...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet he is unable to appreciate these remarkable gifts...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.41,0:16:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为需要一样东西是大卫不会具有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for that would require the one thing that David will never have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我花费终生去找寻这些答案:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have spent my entire lifetime contemplating the questions:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.75,0:16:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来自哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do we come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的使命是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is our purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们死后会怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens when we die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.47,0:16:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最终有两个人他们让我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I have found two people who convinced me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信答案已唾手可得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're on the verge of answering them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍罗威和肖博士 请起身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drs. Holloway and Shaw, if you would please stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.35,0:17:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,据我所知 他俩负责此次任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As far as you're concerned, they're in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泰坦族人普罗米修斯想要给予人类与诸神同等的地位...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Titan Prometheus wanted to give mankind equal footing with the gods...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.32,0:17:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为此 他被逐出奥林匹斯山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and for that, he was cast from Olympus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友 神回归的时刻终于到来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my friends, the time has finally come for his return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,博士们 请吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctors, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The floor is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 哇哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.14,0:17:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.68,0:17:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可从没见过幽灵讲话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never had to follow a ghost before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 让我们看看我们为什么来这的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let me show you why you guys are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:58.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些是世界各地考古采集的图片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are images of archeological digs from all over the Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:17:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,埃及人 玛雅人 苏美尔人 巴比伦人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Egyptian, Mayan, Sumerian, Babylonian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后那个是夏威夷人 然后美索不达米亚人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Hawaiian there at the end, then Mesopotamian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.67,0:18:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个是我们最近的发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, this one here is our most recent discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在苏格兰的天空岛发现的一张35000年前的洞穴壁画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a 35,000-year-old cave painting from the Isle of Skye in Scotland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些古代文明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are ancient civilizations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们相隔数个世纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were separated by centuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们之间没有任何联系 但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They shared no contact with one another, and yet....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些相同的图像...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same pictogram...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.69,0:18:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显示人类崇拜一种巨人生物 指向着的这些星星...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}showing men worshipping giant beings, pointing to the stars...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每张图像都显示着同样的内容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was discovered at every last one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.03,0:18:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一匹配这星图的星系...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the only galactic system that matched...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.70,0:18:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,距离地球非常远...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was so far from Earth that there's no way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以至于这些远古地球文明...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that these primitive, ancient civilizations...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.47,0:18:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能知晓它的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could have possibly known about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但事实确实发生了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it just so happens...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:49.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个星图体系中...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that that system...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有颗太阳...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has a sun...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很像我们的太阳系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a lot like ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.34,0:18:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根据我们的长波扫描 好像那里有颗行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, based on our long-range scans, there seemed to be a planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这颗行星的一个卫星上...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one planet with a moon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.56,0:19:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可维系生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}capable of sustaining life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而今早我们到了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we arrived there this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.23,0:19:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你是说我们来这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're saying we're here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就因为你们两个小孩在洞里找到的一张图 对不对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because of a map you two kids found in a cave. Is that right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.91,0:19:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是图 而是个邀请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not a map, an invitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.53,0:19:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来自谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们叫他们工程师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We call them Engineers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.08,0:19:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,工程师?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engineers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你介意说下他们创造什么东西的么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you mind telling us what they engineered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们创造了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They engineered us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.84,0:19:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么证据能支持你的理论么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so do you have anything to back that up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.27,0:19:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你低估了数世纪之久的达尔文进化论 那就...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if you're willing to discount centuries of Darwinism, that's....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.32,0:19:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But how do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.61,0:20:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我选择去相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's what I choose to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,博士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.77,0:20:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维克丝小姐想在我们这次冒险之前同你们说几句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Vickers would like to have a quick word before the adventure begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦 好地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, nice place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.45,0:20:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上这是飞船的独立舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's actually a separate module{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.51,0:20:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,具有自给的生命维系系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with its own self-contained life support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.04,0:20:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空气 食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air, food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,任何能让维克丝小姐在恶劣环境下生存的东西都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything Miss Vickers would need to survive a hostile environment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她就像活在救生舱里一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so she lives on a lifeboat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:20:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.17,0:20:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like to minimize risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.84,0:21:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫 给博士们来一杯怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, why don't you make the doctors a drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.01,0:21:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要杯伏特加 摇下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take a vodka. Up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理 看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.77,0:21:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个鲍林医疗舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Pauling Med-Pod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们仅制造了十几个这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They only made a dozen of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.98,0:21:16.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Shaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请描述你的病情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please verbally state the nature of your injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请不要触摸那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't touch that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.69,0:21:23.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是非常昂贵的仪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a very expensive piece of machinery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是外科手术用的 你要这个干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It does bypass surgery. What do you need it for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.53,0:21:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别搞混了我们之间的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There might be some confusion about our relationship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.25,0:21:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维兰德先生有足够理由赞助你们这次任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland found you impressive enough to fund this mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我很确定你们所说的工程师...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm fairly certain your Engineers are scribblings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.88,0:21:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无非是生活在肮脏洞穴里的一帮野人而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of savages living in dirty little caves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我错了 如果你们找到了你们所说的生命...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But let's say I'm wrong, and you do find these beings down there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.55,0:21:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不许和他们接触...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you won't engage them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.97,0:21:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不许和他们说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you won't talk to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:21:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都不许做而是直接回来向我汇报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will do nothing but report back to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.90,0:21:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维克丝小姐 是不是还有什么安排...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Vickers, is there an agenda that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.31,0:21:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有告诉我们的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're not telling us about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.52,0:22:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的公司...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My company...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.36,0:22:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,花了一万亿美元找到了这个地方并把你们带来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}paid a trillion dollars to find this place and bring you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.07,0:22:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能自己凑这笔钱的话 霍罗威博士...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had you raised the monies yourself, Mr. Holloway...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.03,0:22:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们将乐意遵照你的安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'd happily be pursuing your agenda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.24,0:22:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你没钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.91,0:22:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你是雇员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that makes you an employee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.96,0:22:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能和他们交流...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if we can't make contact...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.13,0:22:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你需要我们来这干吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why did you even bring us here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.42,0:22:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维兰德先生是个迷信的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland was a superstitious man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要坚定的信仰者留在船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted a true believer onboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.93,0:22:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干杯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有回应?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So no response?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.23,0:22:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.52,0:22:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许他们不懂你的（交流方式）\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they didn't understand it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.81,0:22:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的课程进展如何 大卫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are your lessons going, David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.07,0:22:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我花了两年解析了几十种古代语言的根源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent two years deconstructing dozens of ancient languages to their roots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.05,0:22:51.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我自信我能和他们交流...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm confident I can communicate with them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假如你的论文正确的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}provided your thesis is correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.25,0:22:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"假如是正确的" 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Provided it's correct." That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.54,0:23:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以纸上谈兵被称为论文嘛 博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why they call it a thesis, doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.55,0:23:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你笑什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you smiling about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉威尔先生 钱斯先生 带她下去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Ravel, Mr. Chance, take her down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.47,0:23:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 收到  - 是 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Roger that. - Yes, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.34,0:23:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下降轨道已经绘制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Descent trajectory mapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.14,0:23:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,情况如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How we doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.68,0:23:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.97,0:23:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以了 头儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.48,0:23:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人员注意...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is the captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.77,0:23:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备进入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brace for entry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.35,0:23:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遵命 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.15,0:23:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也一样坐好了 维克丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means you too, Vickers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.82,0:23:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有系统启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All systems online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.45,0:23:34.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大气成分如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is the atmosphere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.87,0:23:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大气含有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atmosphere is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.25,0:23:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,71％氮气...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}71 percent nitrogen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.66,0:23:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,21％氧气...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}21 percent oxygen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,微量的氩气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}traces of argon gas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦 这天气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, now, that's weather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.59,0:23:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像家一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.84,0:23:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你通过呼吸系统呼吸的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're breathing through an exhaust pipe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.17,0:23:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二氧化碳超过3％\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CO2 is over 3 percent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.30,0:23:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,曝露在外2分钟 你就会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes without a suit, you're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.85,0:23:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海拔真高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peak portside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.22,0:23:56.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦 52000英尺!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, 52,000!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.22,0:23:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这让珠穆朗玛峰看起来像个小弟弟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It makes Everest look like a baby brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.64,0:24:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好带 我们下去逛逛吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, take us around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.02,0:24:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将利用它当作进入点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll use that as our point of entry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.19,0:24:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地形图出来了 有好几个硬点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terrain data rezzing up. We've got a couple of hard spots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.20,0:24:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是金属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有信号 没有热源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No radio, no heat source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.80,0:24:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.14,0:24:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沙漠里什么都没有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing in the desert...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.56,0:24:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却没有人不贪求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and no man needs nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.06,0:24:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是我喜欢的一部电影台词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just something from a film I like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.49,0:24:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿过那个通道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go through that gateway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.20,0:24:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,船速保持100节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reduce airspeed by a hundred knots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.87,0:25:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正在穿过 慢点稳点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going through. Nice and slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.67,0:25:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稳住 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it steady, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.92,0:25:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.09,0:25:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, what are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.92,0:25:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍罗威博士 你为何不坐下啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Holloway, why don't you take a seat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.10,0:25:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在那里 上帝不会创造直线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right there. God does not build in straight lines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.55,0:25:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,右舷 山谷里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starboard side, this valley!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.28,0:25:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长 你能降落在那里吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain could you put us down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.19,0:25:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我做不到就没啥好处了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't be any good if I couldn't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.60,0:25:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉威尔先生 90右转舵度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Ravel, starboard 90 degrees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.82,0:25:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 一英里 左舷  - 一英里 左舷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One mile, port bow. - One mile, port bow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.32,0:25:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,启动登陆步序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engage landing sequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.12,0:25:40.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,转手动修正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Switch to manual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.41,0:25:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 开始登陆  - 放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Commence landing. - Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.75,0:25:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 收到  - 是的 宝贝 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Roger that. - Yeah, baby, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.58,0:25:47.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,登陆前5秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bringing her down in five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.13,0:25:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备RCS推进器  - 四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Preparing RCS thrusters. - Four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.59,0:25:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二  慢点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two. Easy does it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.94,0:26:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,引擎系统停止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Generator systems are inactive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.82,0:26:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当前温度是2.724K\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Temperature is at 2.724 K.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.04,0:26:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长 请你让搜索队伍穿戴齐整...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, would you tell the survey team to suit up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.42,0:26:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在气舱和我们会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and meet us in the airlock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.38,0:26:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有6小时就天黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only six hours left of daylight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.34,0:26:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 留待明晨再去吧  - 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leave it till morning. - No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.68,0:26:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是圣诞节 舰长...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Christmas, captain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.35,0:26:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想打开我的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I want to open my presents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.52,0:26:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.52,0:26:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're coming with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.19,0:26:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是我的荣幸啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be delighted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.19,0:26:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意: 入口将在5分钟内打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention: Ramp will open in five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.03,0:26:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克逊...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Jackson...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.95,0:27:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要这个干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what's that for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.99,0:27:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了安全考察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Expedition security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.20,0:27:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的任务就是让每个人安全的回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My job is to make sure everybody is nice and safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.37,0:27:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只是科学考察 不需要武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a scientific expedition. No weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.50,0:27:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.92,0:27:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们好运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.22,0:27:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫 你为什么穿这套装束?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, why are you wearing a suit, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.55,0:27:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beg your pardon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.84,0:27:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是用不着呼吸的 记得么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't breathe, remember?{\r}
