Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.39,0:27:27.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被设计成这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was designed like this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.85,0:27:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你们人类和同类模样的人交流会比较惬意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you people are more comfortable interacting with your own kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.07,0:27:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不穿戴的话 就没有意义了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I didn't wear the suit, it would defeat the purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.36,0:27:39.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和你猜想的差不多是么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're making you guys pretty close, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.91,0:27:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不太一样 我希望是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not too close, I hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.21,0:27:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意: 入口将会在15秒内打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention: Ramp will open in 15 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.09,0:28:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,入口即将打开 五 四 三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ramp will open in five, four, three, two, one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.45,0:28:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只是人类的一小步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just one small step for mankind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.79,0:28:28.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.96,0:28:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们准备好开始了吗?我就知道你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready to do this? I know you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.43,0:28:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费菲尔德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Fifield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.56,0:28:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你看下这个建筑物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want a spectrograph on this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.89,0:28:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道这个是自然形成的还是人造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know if it's natural or if somebody put it there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.31,0:28:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可说不准它是不是自然形成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you if it's natural or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.79,0:28:57.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我能告诉你的是 它是中空的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what I can tell you is, it's hollow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.42,0:29:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普罗米修斯号 你们看到了么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prometheus, are you seeing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.51,0:29:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Affirmative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.01,0:29:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.52,0:29:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.36,0:29:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 好了  - 开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Let's do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.27,0:30:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你先  - 你先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- After you. - After you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.56,0:30:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.69,0:30:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.40,0:30:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普罗米修斯号 我们进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prometheus, we're going in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.56,0:30:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.27,0:30:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这后面是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's back here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.27,0:30:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像是条走廊吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kind of a corridor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.27,0:30:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费菲尔德 把这个建筑网格化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Fifield, let's get a grid of the structure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.06,0:31:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要整个内部结构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the whole interior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.44,0:31:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这里有什么东西值得看的话...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's anything in here worth looking at...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.90,0:31:06.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些小狗能找的到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these pups'll find them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.82,0:31:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"小狗"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Pups"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.95,0:31:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 小狗 我的小狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, pups. My pups.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.09,0:31:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普罗米修斯号 开始绘制数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prometheus, we are now mapping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.14,0:31:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.57,0:31:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真没想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'll be damned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.29,0:32:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费菲尔德 有读数么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifield, you got a read?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.71,0:32:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.59,0:32:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pups are saying this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.11,0:32:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.87,0:32:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.50,0:32:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.87,0:32:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阳光在加热水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sunlight is heating the water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.38,0:32:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,检查下你的仪表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check out the humidity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.13,0:32:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 看看二氧化碳含量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and look at the CO2 levels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.26,0:32:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外面全是呈毒性的 这里完全没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outside it's completely toxic, and in here there's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.55,0:32:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是可呼吸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's breathable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.89,0:32:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.64,0:32:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别像个傻子一样  - 别疑神疑鬼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't be an idiot. - Don't be a skeptic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.39,0:33:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定有什么在产生这里的大气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something generating an atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.90,0:33:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.31,0:33:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 霍罗威博士是对的 - 比地球还干净...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dr. Holloway is correct. - Cleaner than Earth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.65,0:33:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明显\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.98,0:33:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们进行过环境改造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were terraforming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.24,0:33:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托不要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't do...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.86,0:33:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不要戴着这些东西了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not wearing this thing anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.20,0:33:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝我好运 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wish me luck, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.66,0:33:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听到吗?不要摘下你的头盔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you copy? Do not remove your headgear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.84,0:33:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You crazy bastard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.43,0:33:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连接我们衣服上的摄像头...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Connect our suit cameras...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.85,0:33:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想继续观看这场畸形秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you want to continue watching this freak show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.50,0:33:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要拿掉头盔了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are taking our helmets off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.23,0:33:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 改变接受讯号数据方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that. Switching feeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.94,0:33:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 把赌注兑现吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, come on. Pay up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.82,0:33:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 兑现什么? - "兑现"是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pay what? - What do you mean, "Pay what"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.70,0:33:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里有东西在制造可呼吸的气体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something is manufacturing breathable air down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.95,0:34:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就意味着地貌环境改造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That, mate is terraforming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.54,0:34:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 赌的是我们来这儿干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. The bet was why we came here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.29,0:34:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是说那个死老头想和火星人谈谈的话 那我付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you said a dead old man wanted to talk to Martians, I'd pay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.33,0:34:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 100点数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, a hundred credits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.88,0:34:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用这个去让维克丝小姐跳个大腿舞 你认为怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it towards a lap dance with Miss Vickers. How about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.97,0:34:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿达到零下12度了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's minus 12 in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.30,0:34:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么为何这里的水没有结冰呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why is this water not frozen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.60,0:34:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能不是水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it ain't water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.76,0:34:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是火星人的尿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's Martian piss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.27,0:34:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你的科学理论性?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your scientific theory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.48,0:34:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是?生物学家?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it? Mr. Biology?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.61,0:34:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管它是什么 它肯定是胶质的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is, it sure is collagenous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.61,0:34:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,某种沉淀物 也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kind of sediment, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.34,0:34:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.20,0:35:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.87,0:35:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.95,0:35:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.04,0:35:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.29,0:35:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.88,0:35:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾丽!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.06,0:35:43.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那到底是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.68,0:35:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真高兴我们没带任何武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really glad we didn't bring weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.73,0:35:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来吧 艾丽 我们走 - 这是谁的馊主意?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, El. Let's go. - Whose idea was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.44,0:35:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.82,0:35:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.45,0:36:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他去了哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.08,0:36:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等下 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.63,0:36:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那里 在那里 在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There it is. There it is. There it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.72,0:36:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 查理 我们找到了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, Charlie. We found them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.39,0:36:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"他们"是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean "them"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.22,0:36:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是他们 艾丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is them, Ellie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.43,0:36:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看上去像扇门...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like a door...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.39,0:36:32.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像是被什么砍掉了头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he's been decapitated by it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.61,0:36:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狗娘养的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.86,0:36:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.74,0:36:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想让他们怎样?错的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you want them to be? Wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.62,0:36:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.46,0:36:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我你看的懂这些文字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}please tell me you can read that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.79,0:36:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.29,0:36:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我要离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.96,0:37:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费菲尔德 你去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Fifield, where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.47,0:37:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.30,0:37:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我只是个地质学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm just a geologist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.14,0:37:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢石头 我爱石头!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like rocks. I love rocks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.77,0:37:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在很明显你俩根本不在乎什么石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's clear you two don't give a shit about rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.40,0:37:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来你只在乎巨大的死尸罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what you do seem to care about is gigantic dead bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.02,0:37:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我真的帮不上什么忙...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I don't really have anything to contribute...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.86,0:37:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于这个巨型死尸专业...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the gigantic dead body arena...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.16,0:37:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要回船上去了 如果你不介意的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to go back to the ship, if you don't mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.16,0:37:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么人要和我一起走的么?你留下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone wanna join me, hey? You staying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.92,0:37:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 回船上比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, ship's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.13,0:37:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 回船这个决定非常的好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Ship very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.30,0:37:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝贺你跟你的造物主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations on meeting your maker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.13,0:37:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.01,0:37:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你俩别走散了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull yourself together, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.31,0:37:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你是疯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I thought you were the crazy one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.15,0:38:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你带有碳测定读取器吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have the carbon reader?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.36,0:38:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.87,0:38:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它死了多久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long's it been dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.79,0:38:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,2000年左右吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two thousand years give or take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.80,0:38:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么 大卫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing, David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.34,0:38:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要打开这门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm attempting to open the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.22,0:38:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我们还不知道另一边有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. We don't know what's on the other side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.89,0:38:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oops. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.98,0:38:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看啊 福特 这是头部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Ford. It's the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.78,0:38:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保存状况非常良好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An amazing state of preservation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.37,0:38:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们带走吧  - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll take it in. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.21,0:39:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,了不起的人像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remarkably human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.44,0:39:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮的油画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful painting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.23,0:39:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是壁画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a mural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.12,0:39:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.96,0:39:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停 别碰它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop. Don't touch it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.29,0:39:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.54,0:39:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请不要碰任何东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.46,0:39:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,渗出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.08,0:40:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有机生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Organic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.84,0:40:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.14,0:40:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理 壁画开始改变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie, the murals are changing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.01,0:40:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想自我们进来后改变了这里的大气状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we've affected the atmosphere in the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.60,0:40:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理 你收到没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.52,0:40:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 头部!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.64,0:40:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,福特 快啊 帮我把头包起来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ford, quick, help me bag the head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.37,0:40:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 老大  - 什么情况?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Boss. - What you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.87,0:40:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一场风暴即将席卷而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got an incoming storm front.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.95,0:41:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,含大量硅化物...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silica...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.29,0:41:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,具有很多静电 看上去不妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lots of static. This is not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.46,0:41:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.30,0:41:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地面人员...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ground crew...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.34,0:41:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是杰尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is Janek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.51,0:41:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要求你们马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to hustle back right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.63,0:41:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地面人员 你们收到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ground crew, do you copy me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.30,0:41:16.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时速每秒200公里的含硅化物的暴风要到来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got 200-kilometer winds of airborne silica...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.51,0:41:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其产生的静电足以吹干你们衣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and enough static to fry your suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.18,0:41:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.85,0:41:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要多花点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.52,0:41:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我将在15分钟内关闭外门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be closing the outer doors in 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.40,0:41:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我衷心希望你能赶到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sincerely hope you can make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.32,0:41:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理!大卫!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie! David!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.82,0:41:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must leave now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.07,0:41:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是另一个坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just another tomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.25,0:41:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.33,0:41:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 数三下  - 二 三 上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- On three. - Two, three, up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.38,0:41:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点走了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.51,0:41:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢慢 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, easy, easy. Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.34,0:41:57.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫 我们要走了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, we are leaving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.61,0:42:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.61,0:42:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 他们已经起飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, they've already taken off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.48,0:42:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.11,0:42:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普罗米修斯号呼叫地面人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prometheus to ground crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.67,0:42:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们时间快不够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're running out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.41,0:42:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 快点 走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, come on. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.72,0:42:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.99,0:42:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理 那个头!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie! The head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.12,0:43:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾丽 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.83,0:43:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.29,0:43:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 舱门5秒后关闭  - 妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hatch closure in five seconds. - Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.55,0:43:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 等等!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.68,0:43:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.64,0:43:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,门在关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Door closing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.97,0:43:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾丽 别动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.27,0:43:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.48,0:43:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住我的手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab my hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.70,0:43:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.25,0:43:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 艾丽!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Ellie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.33,0:43:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾丽!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.41,0:44:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.38,0:44:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那算是什么 艾丽?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what was that, Ellie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.51,0:44:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想毁了这次任务么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've compromised the mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.53,0:44:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更别说你还差点没命了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to mention almost killing yourself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.72,0:44:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.09,0:44:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.76,0:44:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.43,0:44:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.27,0:44:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,博士们 很高兴你们回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctors, it's real good to have you back,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.41,0:44:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,密尔本和费菲尔德哪儿去了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but where's Millburn and Fifield?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.73,0:44:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们还没回来么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't they back yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.94,0:44:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 帮我联系他们  - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get them up for me. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.36,0:45:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来过这里啊 费菲尔德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been here before, Fifield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.28,0:45:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不清楚 看上去都一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. It all looks the same to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.91,0:45:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是舰长在讲话 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys, this is the captain. Listen up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.54,0:45:10.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在外面一堆静电 还有风速...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Between the static electricity and the wind speed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.46,0:45:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在来找你们不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well, there ain't no safe way to come get you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.38,0:45:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.29,0:45:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,温度下降很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The temperature is dropping rapidly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.04,0:45:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们戴上头盔保持温度...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so get your helmets on and stay warm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.46,0:45:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到这场风暴结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until the storm passes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.63,0:45:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.76,0:45:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能给我帮那个科学家和他那个狂热女友带个话么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can you get a message to the scientist and his zealot girlfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.14,0:45:27.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这儿有笔吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a pen nearby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.35,0:45:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 我想我们得到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, I think we got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.89,0:45:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对他们说... 让他们去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them I said... themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.98,0:45:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.98,0:45:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 好了 伙计们 把你们的头放低些...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that. All right, boys, keep your head down...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.40,0:45:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会在早上去接你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'll come get you in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.44,0:45:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在去哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, which way now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.61,0:45:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.57,0:45:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, which way, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.59,0:46:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,样本消毒了 没有污染迹象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sample is sterile. No contagion present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.01,0:46:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.30,0:46:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说他们都死了么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So are they all dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.56,0:46:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啥?是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.85,0:46:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都死了还是没死?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they all dead or aren't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.69,0:46:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.36,0:46:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们才刚来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.11,0:46:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,扫描\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.53,0:46:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你很在乎他们的生死?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you care if they're dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.86,0:46:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维兰德先生在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weyland cared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.61,0:46:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Shaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.49,0:46:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.21,0:46:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这不是头骨  - 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not an exoskeleton. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.33,0:46:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想这是个头盔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's a helmet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.63,0:46:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 让我们看看能否拿走  - 我们应该...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's see if we can lift it up. - We should...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.05,0:46:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看哪儿能打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}be able to prize this open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.21,0:46:44.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这对我们来说太重了 大卫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too heavy for us. David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.68,0:46:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.18,0:46:54.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一向小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.74,0:47:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他头上是些什么东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that on its head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.99,0:47:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像是些新型细胞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like new cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.04,0:47:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 处于...  - 在突变中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In a state of.... - Change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.21,0:47:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.25,0:47:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,突变成什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Changing into what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.00,0:47:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们做个颅内复原怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you run a stem line into the locus coeruleus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.59,0:47:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想能骗过神经系统让它以为本体还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we can trick the nervous system into thinking it's still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.47,0:47:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 30安培  - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thirty amps. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.30,0:47:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.72,0:47:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来先做个切口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me make an incision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.52,0:47:34.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.86,0:47:41.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上升至40\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go up, 40.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.28,0:47:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 加至40\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, 40 up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.69,0:47:47.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.74,0:47:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 嗯 看到了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Yep. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.70,0:47:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再加10\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go up another 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.62,0:47:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 再加10\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, up 10.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.46,0:47:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可能有点多了 下降10  - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe it's a little too much. Go down 10. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.71,0:48:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 降10  - 再降个20\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Down 10. - Down another 20.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.63,0:48:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我在试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.46,0:48:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在试 它没有下降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying, it's not going down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.26,0:48:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全部下降 福特停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full down. Ford stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.80,0:48:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.30,0:48:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫 把它封闭起来!快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, contain it! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.55,0:48:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,封闭起来?快关掉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contain it? Turn it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.14,0:48:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 是气味!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. The smell!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.43,0:48:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 看看那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.64,0:48:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.81,0:48:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,越来越糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.66,0:48:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凡人 仅此而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mortal, after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.84,0:48:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,福特 取个样本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ford, take a sample.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.34,0:48:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们看下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's have a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.51,0:48:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 先生 我会负责处理的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, I will take care of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.35,0:48:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 先生 我明白 我抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir, understood. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.68,0:49:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很不幸 稍微早产了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortunately, slightly premature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.44,0:49:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.26,0:49:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维克丝小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Vickers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.85,0:49:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他对你说些什么 大卫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he say, David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.48,0:49:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他不想让我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think he'd want me to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.57,0:49:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他到底说了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.07,0:49:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.99,0:49:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是保密的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's confidential.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.33,0:49:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看在老天的份上...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So help me God...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.58,0:50:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要找到让你逃掉的绳子并割了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will find the cord that makes you run and I will cut it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.38,0:50:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.92,0:50:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.26,0:50:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"来点硬的"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Try harder."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.43,0:50:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要来杯茶么 女士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cup of tea, ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.28,0:50:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,提取遗传基因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genetic view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.57,0:50:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.61,0:50:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看下他的DNA\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's have a look at its DNA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.38,0:50:48.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,分离DNA螺旋体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isolate the strand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.25,0:50:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.84,0:50:53.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好基因比对样本?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compare it to the gene sample?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.30,0:50:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.72,0:50:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交叉对比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overlay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.14,0:50:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,处理中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Processing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.43,0:51:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,处理中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Processing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.56,0:51:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,DNA匹配\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DNA match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.23,0:51:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.00,0:51:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.67,0:51:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和我们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.76,0:51:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么杀了他们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What killed them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.32,0:51:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大物始于小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big things have small beginnings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.46,0:52:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有打断你么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I interrupting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.71,0:52:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你挺消沉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you might be running low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.05,0:52:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你自己来一杯 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pour yourself a glass, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.51,0:52:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 但我担心...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, but I'm afraid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.13,0:52:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那对我真是浪费了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would be wasted on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.14,0:52:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我差点忘了你不是一个真正的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, I almost forgot you're not a real boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.39,0:52:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉你的工程师都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very sorry that your Engineers are all gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.73,0:52:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们是白来这一趟了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think we wasted our time coming here, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.57,0:52:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的问题取决于我如何理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your question depends on me understanding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.90,0:52:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里想达成什么目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what you hoped to achieve by coming here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.41,0:52:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然是找到我们的造物者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we hoped to achieve was to meet our makers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.41,0:52:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找寻答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To get answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.96,0:52:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最初为什么他们创造我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why they even made us in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.00,0:52:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为为什么人类造了我呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think your people made me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.67,0:52:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们有能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.76,0:53:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能想象出这样多么令人失望...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you imagine how disappointing it would be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.31,0:53:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当听到你的造物者说出刚刚你同样的话呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to hear the same thing from your creator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.77,0:53:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好在你根本不懂得什么叫失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess it's good you can't be disappointed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.02,0:53:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 真的很奇妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. It's wonderful actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.03,0:53:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能问你个问题么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask you something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.11,0:53:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.20,0:53:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意付出多大代价...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far would you go...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.20,0:53:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去得到你一路过来所想要的那个答案?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get what you came all this way for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.99,0:53:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.62,0:53:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你准备怎么做呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you willing to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.29,0:53:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意付出一切的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything and everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.04,0:53:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就为这喝一杯吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's worth drinking to, I'd imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.72,0:53:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's mud in your eye, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.02,0:53:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你身体健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.28,0:54:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是那些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's those things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.16,0:54:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西是真的么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.16,0:54:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们当然是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course they're real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.41,0:54:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天 我是说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ. I mean....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.42,0:54:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这一堆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the pile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.25,0:54:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看它们堆的有多高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look how high up they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.05,0:54:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看上去...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.96,0:54:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在逃避什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they were running from something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.07,0:54:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 别碰他们 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Don't touch, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.76,0:54:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计 看他们身体好像由里向外爆出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, this thing is opened up from the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.14,0:54:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像内爆炸一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost like it exploded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.68,0:54:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像一幅大屠杀的场景一样 你懂吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like a scene out some sort of holocaust painting, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.71,0:54:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些杀掉他们的东西应该早就不在了 是吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, whatever killed them is long gone, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.09,0:54:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,密尔本 费菲尔德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Millburn, Fifield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.34,0:55:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是普罗米修斯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Prometheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.67,0:55:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.72,0:55:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普罗米修斯号 我是密尔本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prometheus, this is Millburn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.80,0:55:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在7401477 怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are at 7-4-0-1-4-7-7. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.31,0:55:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,距你们西边1公里处有个脉冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just got a ping about one click west of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.02,0:55:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"脉冲"是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean "a ping"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.06,0:55:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, whatever...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.90,0:55:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个探测器探到什么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that probe is picking up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.06,0:55:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它不是死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.40,0:55:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是活着的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's reading a life form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.28,0:55:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么?  - 好吧 什么是"活着的东西"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Okay, what do you mean, "a life form"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.24,0:55:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它...那东西在动么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it... Is it moving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.57,0:55:29.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没 我看不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.83,0:55:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长 你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, you're...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.33,0:55:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,显然肯定没看到...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}obviously not seeing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.04,0:55:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在看到的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what we're seeing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.58,0:55:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你看到 你就不会说什么脉冲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you were, you wouldn't be talking about a ping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.00,0:55:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂 小子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.63,0:55:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自从风暴开始就零星地收到探测器读数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your signal has been coming in sporadically since the storm hit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.09,0:55:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿可是一团糟啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's no good to us down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.13,0:55:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它...它在动吗?现在这些东西还在动吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it... Is it moving? Are these things moving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.93,0:55:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 实际上它消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, it just disappeared, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.44,0:55:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是个故障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be a glitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.69,0:56:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的什么意思 "故障"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, "a glitch"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.36,0:56:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.36,0:56:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,睡好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.44,0:56:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就不用彼此打搅对方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try not to bugger each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.11,0:56:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长 你说的是什么意思 "故障"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, what do you mean, "a glitch"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.74,0:56:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,密尔本 他刚刚说什么来着?等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Millburn, what does he mean? Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.87,0:56:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, he said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.41,0:56:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他说的是在我们西面 是吗? - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He said one click west, yeah? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.96,0:56:19.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.42,0:56:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会去哪儿的吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't want to check that out, do we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.46,0:56:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.67,0:56:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们去哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we gonna go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.13,0:56:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,往东\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}East.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.72,0:56:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对 往东\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.18,0:56:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死的故障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fucking glitch, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.70,0:56:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"脉冲 故障 活物" 什么鬼东西?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Pings, glitch, life form." What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.51,0:56:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,基于这些全息影像记录中的行为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Based on the behavior of the subject in these holographic recordings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.93,0:56:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我仍旧困惑到底什么使得目标的头爆裂开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're attempting to identify what caused the head to combust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.83,0:56:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我忍不住想知道这儿到底发生了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't help but wonder was there an outbreak here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.70,0:56:51.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,按铃了么 女士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You rang, ma'am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.90,0:56:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有一些重要的事情要告诉你 那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have something important to tell you. What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.83,0:56:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.62,0:56:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保存在冰冻香槟中的一朵玫瑰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a rose that I had frozen with the champagne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.17,0:57:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我们找到我们要找的东西时我将会给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna give it to you when we found what we came for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.55,0:57:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们确实找到了我们要找的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did find what we came for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.76,0:57:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们曾在这 这是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were here. This is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.09,0:57:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,历史上最重要的发现...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The most significant discovery in the history...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.85,0:57:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人类历史  我当然知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of mankind. Oh, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.85,0:57:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,了不起 真的了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's incredible, it really is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.85,0:57:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我想和他们谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I wanted to talk to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.02,0:57:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你难道不想知道他们来这干吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, don't you want to know why they came?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.24,0:57:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们为何抛弃我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why they abandoned us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.20,0:57:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要知道答案 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want answers, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.20,0:57:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是对的 查理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were right, Charlie.{\r}
