Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.89,0:58:04.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 你现在应该把你爸的十字架拿下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I guess you can take your father's cross off now.{\r}
