Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.91,1:03:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.99,1:03:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,割掉它!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.04,1:03:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,割掉它!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.91,1:03:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,割掉它!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.91,1:03:54.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,割掉它!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.54,1:03:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.33,1:03:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.38,1:04:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God! Oh, Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.84,1:04:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它进到我的衣服里了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in my suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.26,1:04:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.15,1:05:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖 你在吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw, you up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.66,1:05:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在 怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, what's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.20,1:05:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,风暴过去了 但我联系不到密尔本或是费菲尔德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The storm passed, but I can't reach Millburn or Fifield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.58,1:05:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放一些人下去 看看能否发现他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taking a few men down, see if I can rustle them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.95,1:05:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.00,1:05:20.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他们大致在哪儿么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any idea where they are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.75,1:05:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上次和他们通话的时候他们就在你们发现头的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time they radioed in was where you found your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.96,1:05:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we're coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.09,1:05:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.01,1:05:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱斯 你跟我来 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chance, you're coming with me. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.01,1:05:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了 头儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.85,1:05:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拉威尔 你认为那是故障么? - 不是 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ravel, did you fix that glitch? - No, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.81,1:05:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可能是硬件的问题  - 什么故障 舰长?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's gotta be in the hardware. - What glitch, captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.73,1:05:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其中一个探测器检测到有活着的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them probes picked up a life form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.98,1:05:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是不到一会讯号就消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pops up every hour for a couple of seconds and then it's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.19,1:05:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能找到那些探测器并修好它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can find the probe and fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.94,1:05:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随你便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock yourself out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.86,1:05:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点 博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful, doctors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.60,1:06:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费菲尔德!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifield!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.10,1:06:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,密尔本!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Millburn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.56,1:06:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, come on down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.96,1:06:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫 你一个人么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, are you alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.05,1:06:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 维克丝小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Miss Vickers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.34,1:06:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我房间视频信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uplink your feed to my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.68,1:06:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.57,1:08:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这狗娘养的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.87,1:08:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,竟敢掐了我的讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cut me off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.68,1:09:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.73,1:09:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 查理?  - 我滑了下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Charlie? - I just tripped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.23,1:09:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 你病了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, you're sick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.57,1:09:15.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事 继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm okay, baby. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.65,1:09:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费菲尔德!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifield?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.53,1:09:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,密尔本!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Millburn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.20,1:09:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱斯 我是你可不会碰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Chance. I wouldn't touch that if I were you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.96,1:09:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖博士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Shaw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.46,1:09:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.75,1:09:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这里漏出瓮的液体是什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we have any idea what is oozing out of these vases?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.51,1:09:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 上次我们来的时候它们可不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. They weren't like this last time we were here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.39,1:09:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.72,1:09:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.23,1:09:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪一位?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is it? Which one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.35,1:09:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那个是谁? - 是密尔本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is it? - It's Millburn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.73,1:09:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 艾丽  - 别碰他 停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ellie. - Don't touch him. Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.77,1:09:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾丽 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.77,1:09:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理 怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie, what's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.78,1:09:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你看着我 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to look at me, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.49,1:10:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是感染...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know infections...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.78,1:10:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你看到了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so, what do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.99,1:10:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不太妙 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not good, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.78,1:10:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我 告诉我你看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look at me, you tell me what you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.96,1:10:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.29,1:10:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,福特 快过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ford, get over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.04,1:10:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系 杰尼克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. Janek?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.79,1:10:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么? - 我们还是快离开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - We have to go now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.59,1:10:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底看到了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.46,1:10:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 你看到什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, what do you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.63,1:10:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍罗威病了 他不太好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holloway's sick. He's not good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.88,1:10:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,食道里像是什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see movement in his esophagus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.64,1:10:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点 宝贝  - 不 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, baby. - No. I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.48,1:10:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰尼克!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Janek!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.60,1:10:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长过来帮我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come over and help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.98,1:10:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我没事  - 福特 过来看看 这是怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm okay. - Ford, get over there. What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.48,1:10:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我没事  - 走吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm okay. - Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.65,1:10:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我看着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.94,1:10:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧 我们快点离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you. We're gonna get you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.99,1:10:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普罗米修斯号...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prometheus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.82,1:10:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.65,1:10:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 注意头顶  - 好的 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch your head. - Okay. I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.74,1:10:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 霍罗威  - 抬起他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Holloway. - Get him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.66,1:10:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点  - 普罗米修斯号 收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Prometheus, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.66,1:10:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is anyone there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.50,1:10:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是维克丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Vickers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.91,1:10:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要医疗队在气舱处等候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a medical team standing by the airlock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.71,1:10:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全面隔离检疫处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full quarantine fail-safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.92,1:10:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍罗威病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holloway's sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.55,1:10:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么病?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sick with what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.96,1:11:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 照做就是了  - 我们把他送回船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just do it. - Let's get him back to the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.26,1:11:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那下边不安全  - 查理?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's not safe down here. - Charlie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.51,1:11:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去换衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm suiting up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.51,1:11:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 查理 跟我说  - 走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Charlie, talk to me. - Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.35,1:11:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么东西在后面?  - 走吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was that back there? - Let's go, people!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.39,1:11:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走!我们得走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've gotta move! We've gotta move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.09,1:15:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他看上去不太妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He don't look too good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.51,1:15:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他抓着什么东西么?我们的头盔丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he catch something down there? We had our helmets off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.39,1:15:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.39,1:15:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普罗米修斯号 我是杰尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prometheus, this is Janek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.89,1:15:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确保后门是开着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure that back door is open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.77,1:15:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遵命 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.02,1:15:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!我很抱歉!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.10,1:15:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用力!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.52,1:15:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.07,1:15:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普罗米修斯号!为什么不开门?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prometheus! Why is that door not open?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.12,1:15:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维克丝 这是命令!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vickers, that is an order!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.74,1:15:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打开那见鬼的门!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that goddamn door open!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.54,1:15:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 看着我 太迟了 我病了  - 不 还没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look at me. It's too late, I'm sick. - No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.25,1:15:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.17,1:15:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,福特 帮我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ford, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.25,1:15:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,气闸员 如果你听到了 我是杰尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Airlock crew, if you can hear me, it's Janek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.46,1:15:50.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上打开后门!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open that back door right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.25,1:15:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开门!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold that door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.59,1:15:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普罗米修斯号...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prometheus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.42,1:15:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你收到没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.34,1:15:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼 快开门!这是命令!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn it, open that door! That is an order!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.01,1:15:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开门!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.14,1:16:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.31,1:16:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维克丝 他是位病人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vickers, this is a sick man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.98,1:16:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 这正是不能让他上船的原因!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see that. That's why he's not coming on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.11,1:16:13.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.28,1:16:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱斯 过来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chance, get over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.62,1:16:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.49,1:16:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得救救他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can still help him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.24,1:16:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除霍罗威外 全体人员马上回到船上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help yourself. Everybody but Holloway back on this ship!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.00,1:16:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能丢下他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't leave him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.75,1:16:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等!我们可以把他放进医疗舱!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! We could put him on the Med-Pod!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.96,1:16:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你别这么做!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.17,1:16:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的 艾丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, Ellie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.67,1:16:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维克丝!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vickers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.84,1:16:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.13,1:16:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.47,1:16:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我爱你 - 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I love you. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.47,1:16:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我警告你 别过来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you, stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.93,1:16:39.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.80,1:16:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,退回去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.85,1:16:41.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 查理!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No, Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.10,1:16:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来吧 - 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do it. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.44,1:16:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.69,1:16:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.53,1:16:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.86,1:16:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.70,1:17:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.72,1:17:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,致以我最深切的慰问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My deepest condolences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.01,1:17:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得拿走它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to have to take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.97,1:17:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它可能被感染了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may be contaminated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.64,1:17:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果它会传染 我们都有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's a contagion, we were all exposed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.27,1:17:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要... 我们必须对接触金字塔的人进行验血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need... We need to run blood work on everyone who set foot in the pyramid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.73,1:17:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.40,1:17:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.04,1:17:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这不太妥当...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand how inappropriate this is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.88,1:17:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鉴于这种情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}given the circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.38,1:17:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是当你被下令隔离...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as you ordered quarantine fail-safes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.22,1:18:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有责任要这样问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's my responsibility to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.43,1:18:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最近和霍罗威博士有过亲密接触吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you and Dr. Holloway had any intimate contact recently?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.93,1:18:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自从你和他走得很近后...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since you and he were so close...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.44,1:18:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想尽可能搞清楚...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to be as thorough as poss...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.90,1:18:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My, my.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.95,1:18:20.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怀孕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.70,1:18:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.87,1:18:27.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看上去 有三个月大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the look of it, three months so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.08,1:18:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 那不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.46,1:18:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不可能怀孕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't be pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.88,1:18:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有和霍罗威博士发生性关系吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have intercourse with Dr. Holloway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.05,1:18:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.42,1:18:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是10小时以前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but 10 hours ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.80,1:18:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根本不可能我会怀孕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no bloody way I'm three months pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.47,1:18:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,博士...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, doctor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.31,1:18:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看上去胎儿也挺不正常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not exactly a traditional fetus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.10,1:18:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.27,1:18:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不认为这是个好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't think that's a good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.82,1:19:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫 我想看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, I want to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.95,1:19:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 博士...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, doctor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.66,1:19:07.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要看看它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.24,1:19:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把它取出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want it out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.91,1:19:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这里没有适合的人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have the personnel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.66,1:19:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能够做这种处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to perform a procedure like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.33,1:19:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 最好的选择是... - 我要拿掉这个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Our best option... - I want it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.34,1:19:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把你放入冷冻休眠舱 直到我们返回地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put you back into cryostasis until we return to Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.59,1:19:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 把它取出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, get it out of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.22,1:19:23.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把它取出来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it out of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.93,1:19:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.23,1:19:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你一样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, let me give you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.36,1:19:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了 那里 那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it. There, there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.45,1:19:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上就会有人来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone will be along shortly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.33,1:19:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把你送去冷冻舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to bring you back to Cryo Deck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.00,1:19:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定觉得你的神抛弃了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must feel like your God abandoned you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.88,1:19:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.21,1:19:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,死了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To lose...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.17,1:20:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍罗威博士跟你爸爸死于一样的状况之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Holloway after your father died under such similar circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.47,1:20:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么杀死他的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was it that killed him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.30,1:20:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊波拉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ebola?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.14,1:20:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么... 你是怎么知道的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you... How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.02,1:20:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看了你的梦境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I watched your dreams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.38,1:20:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖博士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Shaw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.76,1:20:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这儿把你放入抗感染外套里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here to put you in an anti-contamination suit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.53,1:20:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后送你去冷冻舱里休眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take you back to Cryo Deck go to beddy-byes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.93,1:20:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖博士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Shaw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.93,1:20:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她被麻醉了 做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's doped. Prepare her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.42,1:21:28.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,紧急救治手术启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency procedures initiated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.01,1:21:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请口头描述你的病情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please verbally state the nature of your injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.35,1:21:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要剖腹产手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a Caesarean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.81,1:21:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,错误 医疗舱为男性病人标准制定使用...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Error. This Med-Pod is calibrated for male patients...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.93,1:21:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能进行你所要求的手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and does not offer the procedure you have requested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.97,1:21:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请查看其它的医疗帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seek medical assistance elsewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.36,1:21:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,手术（人工自定义手术）\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.44,1:21:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,腹部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abdominal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.53,1:21:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿透...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Penetrating...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.45,1:21:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,深部损伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}injuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.07,1:21:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,异物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foreign body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.99,1:21:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.74,1:21:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外科手术程序开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surgical procedure to begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.12,1:22:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,运行诊断程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running diagnostics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.71,1:22:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.63,1:22:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快出去!快啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get it out! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.30,1:22:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.34,1:22:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.89,1:22:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点!  - 开始麻醉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - Initiating anesthetics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.89,1:23:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.15,1:23:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始外科手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commence surgical procedure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.98,1:23:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.57,1:23:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.41,1:23:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.30,1:24:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊!天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God! Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.18,1:24:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.24,1:24:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.64,1:25:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舰桥呼叫机库 我是舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bridge to hangar. This is the captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.23,1:25:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 收到 舰长  - 你能看到我所看到的么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, captain. - Can you see what I see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.52,1:25:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费菲尔德的监视镜头突然出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifield's monitor just popped up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.86,1:25:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?在哪儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.86,1:25:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,依据我所看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to what I'm looking at,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.75,1:25:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就在该死的船外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's outside the goddamn ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.03,1:25:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巴恩斯 打开门!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barnes, open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.36,1:25:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费菲尔德 你收到没?说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifield, do you copy me? Come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.28,1:25:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费菲尔德?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifield?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.30,1:25:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.72,1:25:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,华莱士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Wallace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.81,1:25:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看下这个什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.73,1:25:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费菲尔德?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifield?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.23,1:25:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下面到底出了什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.08,1:26:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我下去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.38,1:26:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱斯 你把衣服换上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chance, you're suiting up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.75,1:26:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点  - 别把它留在船上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Don't let it on the ship!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.56,1:26:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.90,1:26:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.77,1:26:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.28,1:26:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 准备好了 钱斯? -好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You ready, Chance? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.41,1:26:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.45,1:26:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到车里面来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the rover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.54,1:26:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得离开这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta get out of here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.96,1:26:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.33,1:27:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.03,1:28:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直在深眠中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.37,1:28:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直就在船上 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were on the ship all this time. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.50,1:28:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.12,1:28:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经时日无多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a few days of life left in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.21,1:28:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想浪费时间...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't wanna waste them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.67,1:28:19.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到你能实现你的承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until you could deliver what you promised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.05,1:28:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,见我的造物主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To meet my maker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.80,1:28:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we are, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.22,1:28:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 干干净净  - 你怎么不告诉他造物主们都死了呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nice and clean. - Haven't you told him they're all gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.97,1:28:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他们没全死 肖博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they're not all gone, Dr. Shaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.39,1:28:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其中一个还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them is still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.81,1:28:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在就准备去见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on our way to see him now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.98,1:28:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.40,1:28:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我转过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn me around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.40,1:28:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你让我相信...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You convinced me that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.78,1:28:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这些造物主创造了我们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if these things made us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.20,1:28:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同样他们也可以挽救我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then surely they could save us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.41,1:28:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的拐杖 帮下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My stick, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.08,1:29:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之他们会救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, save me, anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.75,1:29:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救你什么啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save you from what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.42,1:29:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然是我的命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.18,1:29:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.72,1:29:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.56,1:29:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.73,1:29:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.14,1:29:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就不了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.06,1:29:20.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.61,1:29:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这地方根本就不是我们想象的地方 他们也不是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place isn't what we thought it was. They aren't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.57,1:29:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想象的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what we thought they were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.78,1:29:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.11,1:29:28.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真是大错特错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were so wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.91,1:29:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查理...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie....{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.95,1:29:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍罗威博士死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Holloway's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.45,1:29:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须离开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must leave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.96,1:29:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得现在查理会做什么...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what would Charlie do...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.21,1:29:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们如此之接近...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}now that we're so close...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.38,1:29:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以解答人类历史上最有意义的问题吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to answering the most meaningful questions ever asked by mankind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.84,1:29:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎能就此一走了之而什么都不过问呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you leave without knowing what they are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.73,1:30:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是你丧失信仰了么 肖?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or have you lost your faith, Shaw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.89,1:30:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.00,1:31:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.55,1:31:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底要去哪里 博士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell are you going, doc?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.89,1:31:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这是什么地方吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what this place is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.30,1:31:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些工程师?这里可不是他们的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those Engineers? This ain't their home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.43,1:31:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个基地 更像是军事基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an installation. Maybe even military.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.40,1:31:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在这个地方建造基地是因为他们可不会蠢到...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They put it out here because they're not stupid enough...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.27,1:31:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在自己家门口实验这种大规模杀伤性武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make weapons of mass destruction on their own doorstep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.19,1:31:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是那些在瓮里的狗屁东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what all that shit is in those vases.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.16,1:31:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在这里制造了它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They made it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.53,1:31:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们逃了出来 它们进行反扑 结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It got out, it turned on them. The end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.58,1:31:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是时候回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time for us to go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.25,1:31:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们中的一个还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them is still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.67,1:31:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不想知道他会说些什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you want to know what they have to say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.68,1:31:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.27,1:32:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.18,1:32:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的职责只是驾驶飞船而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you do is fly the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.44,1:32:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.77,1:32:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你肯定在意些东西 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you must care about something, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.74,1:32:14.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然你怎么会来这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you didn't, why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.45,1:32:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不这样吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.91,1:32:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管发生什么事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what happens down there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.50,1:32:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会允许带着这些东西跟我们回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't bring none of that shit back home with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.13,1:32:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝不能让此事发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't let it happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.92,1:32:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我要竭尽全力确保此事不会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do whatever I have to to see that it doesn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.09,1:32:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要说到做到 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure you do, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.15,1:32:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你终于来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you came after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.57,1:32:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你想去见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you wanted me to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.41,1:32:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然你极力阻止我来到这里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all your attempts to stop me from coming here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.03,1:33:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也吓了你一跳吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surprised to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.24,1:33:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行了 你下去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.04,1:33:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.51,1:33:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你前去的话 你会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're going down there, you will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.14,1:33:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你总是往不好的那面看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very negative way of looking at things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.19,1:33:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你早就应该呆在家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly why you should have stayed at home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.02,1:33:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的以为我能安心的坐在董事会会议室几年...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you really think I was gonna sit in a boardroom for years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.19,1:33:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去和人争论谁来当家管事...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}arguing over who was in charge...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.03,1:33:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你去寻找什么奇迹...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while you go look for some miracle on some...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.53,1:33:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是太空深处的倒霉石头吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}godforsaken rock in the middle of space?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.12,1:33:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,国王是有统治权 但他也会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A king has his reign, and then he dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.46,1:33:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是不可避免的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.34,1:33:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是自然法则决定的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the natural order of things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.23,1:34:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说完了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.48,1:34:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说完了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.15,1:34:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.32,1:34:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.25,1:34:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没料到你骨子里这么有能耐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think you had it in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.71,1:34:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.55,1:34:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor choice of words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.22,1:34:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是有非凡的求生本能 伊丽莎白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Extraordinary survival instincts, Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.52,1:34:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是维兰德死了没人帮你编制程序了会怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens when Weyland is not around to program you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.65,1:34:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我就自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose I'll be free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.19,1:34:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你想要的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.69,1:34:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"想"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Want"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.40,1:35:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不熟悉这个概念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a concept I'm familiar with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.57,1:35:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,话虽如此...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That being said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.16,1:35:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是每个人都想自己的父母死啊?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't everyone want their parents dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.20,1:35:08.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.37,1:35:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Shaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.87,1:35:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你能加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So pleased you could join us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.10,1:35:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要是愿意就摘下头盔好了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can take your helmet off if you like, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.39,1:35:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.31,1:35:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空气是可以呼吸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The air is perfectly breathable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.98,1:35:35.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.31,1:35:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Positive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.82,1:35:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等下 我们仍然不知道霍罗威是如何感染的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. We still don't know how Holloway got infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.25,1:35:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假如是空气传染的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's in the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.20,1:35:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是空气传染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.91,1:35:45.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.95,1:35:46.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smells fine to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.62,1:35:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们继续? - 请吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shall we?   - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.50,1:35:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,桥头就在前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bridge is just up ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.42,1:35:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.67,1:36:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是货物舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a cargo hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.52,1:36:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰尼克?你看到了么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Janek? Are you seeing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.48,1:36:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那儿有多少 肖?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many is there, Shaw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.86,1:36:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,数千\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thousands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.02,1:36:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.70,1:36:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉威尔 给我那些探测器读数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ravel, give me those schematics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.54,1:36:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在桌面上显示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Putting it on the table now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.04,1:36:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除掉那个圆顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strip away the dome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.67,1:36:37.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,分离那个区域 来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isolate that area, bring it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.63,1:36:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bringing it up, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.34,1:36:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enlarge that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.55,1:36:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旋转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rotate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.97,1:36:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是艘飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.48,1:36:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.98,1:36:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是艘该死的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a goddamn ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.19,1:37:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高等物种 毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A superior species, no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.20,1:37:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的深眠舱出人意料 我相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their hypersleep chambers will impress, I trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.59,1:37:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么他们是准备前往某个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they were traveling somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.79,1:37:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经弄清了大概的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've managed to work out the broad strokes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.38,1:37:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很显然他们正准备离开...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fairly evident they were in the process of leaving...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.22,1:37:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在大难临头之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before things went to pot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.68,1:37:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前往哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leaving to go where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.94,1:37:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.94,1:37:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.81,1:37:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候创造前必先毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes to create one must first destroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.11,1:37:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪里 大卫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he, David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.74,1:37:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.21,1:37:58.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定他还活着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure he's alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.38,1:38:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.92,1:38:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能和他对话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you can speak to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.63,1:38:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.42,1:38:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all right, I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.84,1:38:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟他说吧 大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak to him, David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.39,1:38:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟他说我们来过 就像他问的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him we came, just like he asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.35,1:38:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问他们从何而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask where they're from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.14,1:38:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.18,1:38:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问他在货物舱里是什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask him what's in his cargo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.02,1:38:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些东西杀人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It killed his people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.02,1:39:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖 够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw, enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.44,1:39:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大卫 - 你在这里制造这东西...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- David. - You made it here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.69,1:39:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是用来对付我们的 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it was meant for us. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.52,1:39:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了 看在上帝的份上 让她闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough. For God's sake, shut her up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.53,1:39:10.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要知道这是为什么!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to know why!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.82,1:39:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们做错了什么?你为什么恨我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did we do wrong? Why do you hate us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.43,1:39:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她要是再再张嘴 就毙了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She opens her mouth again, shoot her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.53,1:39:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大卫 继续 告诉他我此行目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}David, continue. Tell him why I came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.35,1:39:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.23,1:39:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,福特!跑!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ford! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.38,1:40:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算是白费功夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.26,1:40:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.76,1:40:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一路走好 维兰德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a good journey, Mr. Weyland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.19,1:40:27.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是时候回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.20,1:40:44.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱斯先生 带我们回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Chance, take us home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.32,1:41:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.04,1:42:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.58,1:42:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那到底是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.92,1:42:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普罗米修斯号!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prometheus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.21,1:42:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到没?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.09,1:42:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖 是你吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaw, is that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.51,1:42:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.42,1:42:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰尼克...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Janek...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.26,1:43:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.18,1:43:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那艘船启动出发了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ship is taking off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.60,1:43:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么?  - 她到底再说些什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - What is she talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.39,1:43:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能丢下它!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't let it leave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.22,1:43:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须阻止它!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.60,1:43:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不会管 肖 我们回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not stopping anything, Shaw. We're going home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.73,1:43:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰尼克 如果我们不阻止这艘船...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Janek, if you don't stop it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.94,1:43:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就没得家可回了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there won't be any home to go back to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.78,1:43:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那艘船装载着死亡 它向着地球去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's carrying death, and it's headed for Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.70,1:43:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 肖 那可不是什么战舰  - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shaw, this is not a warship. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.24,1:43:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.20,1:43:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.12,1:43:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你必须这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you must do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.45,1:43:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,舰长 我们走吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.29,1:43:31.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杰尼克 求求你相信我!求你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Janek, please believe me! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.06,1:43:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你快让这飞船飞起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to get this ship going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.64,1:43:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Ravel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.64,1:43:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加热离子推进器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warm up the ion propulsion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.31,1:43:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你胡说些什么?  - 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you talking about? - Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.15,1:43:55.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这种大气下加热离子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burning ion in the atmosphere...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.98,1:43:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把我们变成子弹 就是这个意思  - 你到底想干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Turns us into a bullet. That's the point. - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.24,1:44:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这船是我的 我要你带我们回家!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my ship. I'm telling you to take us home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.40,1:44:05.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维克丝 我要弹射掉你的救生独立舱 可维持两年生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vickers, I'll eject your module onto that surface. Two years of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.99,1:44:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是想要它 还是想留在这里和我在一起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want it, or you want to stay with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.91,1:44:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有40秒去逃生舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got 40 seconds to get to the escape pod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.58,1:44:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.83,1:44:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先生们我能自己驾驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen I can handle this myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.34,1:44:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们和维克丝小姐一起走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel free to join Miss Vickers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.96,1:44:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我尊敬你 舰长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All due respect, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.51,1:44:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可不是驾驶员 你需要我们所有的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a shit pilot and you're gonna need all the help you can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.03,1:44:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 如果你不能和你爱的人在一起 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ Well, if you can't be with the one you love ∮{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.36,1:44:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你觉得赌注取消了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you think this means the bet's off...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.95,1:44:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你可就错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.83,1:44:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为何你不去另一个世界付给我呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you pay me on the other side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.37,1:44:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我们尽量靠近点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, get us as close as we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.62,1:44:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only got one shot at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.64,1:45:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丢掉负重!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lifeboats away!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.56,1:45:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还剩20秒撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty seconds to evacuate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.57,1:45:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 添加混合燃料  - 离子推力启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Countdown initiated. - Ion propulsion is online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.62,1:45:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,十\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.74,1:45:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.70,1:45:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.75,1:45:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,八\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.01,1:45:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 三  - 先生们 动手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Three. - Gentleman, let's do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.51,1:45:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.72,1:45:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警告即将撞击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impact imminent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.77,1:45:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.05,1:46:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.35,1:47:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.52,1:47:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不!不!不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.87,1:47:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.39,1:47:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警告: 还剩下2分钟的氧气量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning: You have two minutes of oxygen remaining.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.11,1:48:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警告: 还剩下30秒的氧气量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning: You have 30 seconds of oxygen remaining.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.54,1:49:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,气舱关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Airlock sealed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.29,1:49:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,氧气含量现在稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oxygen levels now stabilizing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.75,1:50:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白 听得到我么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth, are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.21,1:50:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是大卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.63,1:50:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 是的 我听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah. Yeah, I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.42,1:50:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该马上离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to get out immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.01,1:50:39.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他找你来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.14,1:50:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁来了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.72,1:50:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,气舱被打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Airlock breach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.44,1:50:52.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.03,1:52:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.95,1:52:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.45,1:52:25.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.99,1:52:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对不起你 查理 我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Charlie, I can't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.62,1:52:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do it anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.17,1:52:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伊丽莎白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elizabeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.63,1:52:40.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.34,1:52:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖博士...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Shaw...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.56,1:52:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你听得到我么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.14,1:52:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.85,1:52:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我听得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I can hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.56,1:52:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真怕你死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was afraid you were dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.19,1:53:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不知道什么叫怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea what afraid is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.99,1:53:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我们有所分歧...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know we've had our differences...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.20,1:53:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.58,1:53:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to ask you for your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.04,1:53:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要帮你?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why the hell would I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.33,1:53:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为没有我 你将不能离开这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because, without me, you'll never leave this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.88,1:53:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反正我们哪个都不可能离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither one of us is leaving this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.51,1:53:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是唯一的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the only ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.43,1:53:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有很多这样的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are many others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.89,1:53:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能驾驶他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can operate them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.40,1:53:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖博士?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Shaw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.58,1:53:57.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肖博士!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Shaw!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.25,1:54:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.13,1:54:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的十字架呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is my cross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.59,1:54:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我的工具腰带里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pouch in my utility belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.24,1:54:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经历了这一切...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even after all this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.24,1:54:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还存有信仰 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you still believe, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.12,1:54:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你懂得他们的导航...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you could understand their navigation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.67,1:54:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用他们的星图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}use their maps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.92,1:54:42.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.80,1:54:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要我们去到另一艘飞船里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we get to one of their other ships...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.30,1:54:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就可以直接找到一条回地球的路径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}finding a path to Earth should be relatively straightforward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.13,1:54:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想回到我们来的那个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to go back to where we came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.93,1:54:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想去到他们的所在之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to go where they came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.98,1:55:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为你做的到么 大卫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think you can do that, David?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.28,1:55:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.11,1:55:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信我做的到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.33,1:55:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能问下你去哪儿想达成什么目的么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask what you hope to achieve by going there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.62,1:55:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们创造了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They created us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.92,1:55:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他们想要杀死我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then they tried to kill us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.00,1:55:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们改变了主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They changed their minds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.51,1:55:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有权知道这是为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I deserve to know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.34,1:55:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个答案可能无关紧要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer is irrelevant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.01,1:55:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么改变主意真的没关系吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it matter why they changed their minds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.02,1:55:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.52,1:55:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这当然要紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.19,1:55:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.86,1:55:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.03,1:55:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜那是因为我是人类...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess that's because I'm a human being...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.24,1:55:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你是个机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're a robot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.54,1:56:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.67,1:56:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's quite all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.06,1:56:23.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普罗米修斯号最后汇报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Final report of the vessel Prometheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.02,1:56:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,船和所有船员都已损失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship and her entire crew are gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.48,1:56:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们收到此信号...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're receiving this transmission...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.53,1:56:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要企图追溯它的源头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}make no attempt to come to its point of origin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.07,1:56:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里只有死亡 我已弃之离去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is only death here now, and I'm leaving it behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.37,1:56:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天公元2094年的新年第一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is New Year's Day the year of our Lord, 2094.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.29,1:56:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字叫伊丽莎白·肖...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Elizabeth Shaw...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.00,1:56:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,普罗米修斯号最后的幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the last survivor of the Prometheus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.42,1:56:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我仍在探索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am still searching.{\r}
